            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Chay Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Todd Persaud\nChiang Mai, Thailand4 contributions\n0\nThank you Am Thuc Chay!\nSep 2019\nAm Thuc Chay is one of my favorite vegetarian restaurants in Da Nang. It offers a really relaxed environment. The food is always tasty, the owner is a really sweet lady, and I'm always leaving this restaurant feeling full and satisfied. The location is great because it's easy to get to a co-working space from the restaurant or an office or a place to do your work. Unlike many restaurants in Da Nang, I find the staff here always courteous and pleased to have me. Even more remarkable, the courteousness doesn't feel fake, it feels real, which is more than I can say for many of the other establishments in this city where smiles are forced upon people's faces like they were some kind of sycophant. And did I mention the food is tasty? It's amazing! I love it! Every time! \n\nThank you Am Thuc Chay!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 3, 2019",
