            "review_text": "Erik from USA\n11 contributions\n1\nBeware the Unordered Appetizer Scam\nJan 2019 • Solo\nWas very disappointed when 5 minutes after I sat down the Owner put an unordered plate of what looked to be day old Spring Rolls on the table. Since I did not order the Spring Rolls I asked what they were and the owner pointed to the menu and price and said for me to pay her 30000 dong.\n\nI immediately got up and left.\n\nCost to me = 5 Minutes wasted\nValue of lesson learned by owner = Priceless\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2019",
