            "review_text": "Nick T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam58 contributions\n0\nGood Local Vegetarian Food\nJul 2018 • Solo\nThere seem to be a growing number of vegetarian restaurants around the centre of Danang. Many are aimed at locals, but have English menus and enthusiastic young helpers trying out their English. This is one of those places, and with food from 22 000 VND and up, you can't really go wrong. The food was tasty enough.\nFree wifi to Google translate any questions, otherwise enjoy the food.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 17, 2018",
